WEBVTT

00:10.618 --> 00:12.928
Gary!
加里！

00:13.032 --> 00:14.894
Gary!
加里！

00:14.997 --> 00:16.859
Gary!
加里！

00:16.963 --> 00:18.928
Gary!
加里！

00:19.032 --> 00:21.584
- Meow.
- Gary?
- 喵。
- 加里？

00:22.204 --> 00:23.894
Where are you, Gere-bear?
基尔熊，你在哪里？

00:23.997 --> 00:25.480
Meow.
喵。

00:25.584 --> 00:28.239
- Meow.
- Gary!
- 喵。
- 加里！

00:32.032 --> 00:33.066
Gary!
加里！

00:33.170 --> 00:35.549
How did you get up there,
you silly snail?
你是怎么爬上去的，
你这个傻蜗牛？

00:35.652 --> 00:37.066
Come on. Jump!
快点。跳！

00:37.170 --> 00:38.273
Jumpity-jump-jump-jump!
跳-跳-跳-跳！

00:38.377 --> 00:39.377
Meow.
喵。

00:39.480 --> 00:40.618
Huh.
呵呵。

00:40.721 --> 00:44.135
"In case of pet in tree,
pull down."
“如果宠物在树上，
拉下来。”

00:44.239 --> 00:45.273
All right.
好的。

00:50.515 --> 00:53.963
Did someone call
the fire department?
有人打电话吗
消防部门？

00:55.790 --> 00:58.273
Wow.
哇。

00:58.825 --> 01:01.170
Step aside, citizen.
公民，靠边站吧。

01:01.273 --> 01:03.480
Ladder. First aid. Blanket.
梯子。急救。毯子。

01:03.584 --> 01:05.894
Let's hustle, people. Hustle!
让我们加油吧，人们。喧嚣！

01:10.032 --> 01:11.721
Okay.
好的。

01:13.135 --> 01:14.342
Here I come.
我来了。

01:15.135 --> 01:16.101
Yeah.
是的。

01:16.204 --> 01:18.066
You're safe now, sonny.
你现在安全了，儿子。

01:18.411 --> 01:21.032
Almost there.
快到了。

01:21.652 --> 01:23.584
Meow. Meow.
喵。喵。

01:28.032 --> 01:31.101
Thank you for rescuing
my little Gare bear.
谢谢你的救命之恩
我的小车站熊。

01:32.584 --> 01:33.825
Hey, Larry.
嘿，拉里。

01:33.928 --> 01:35.997
I'd like to be a firefighter.
我想成为一名消防员。

01:36.101 --> 01:38.721
Can I be one, please?
Can I please?
请问我可以成为其中一员吗？
我可以吗？

01:38.825 --> 01:40.135
Sorry, SpongeBob.
对不起，海绵宝宝。

01:40.239 --> 01:42.066
There are no openings
at this time.
没有空缺
此时。

01:46.894 --> 01:50.894
I think I shattered
my skeleton.
我想我崩溃了
我的骷髅。

01:51.273 --> 01:54.135
Again.
再次。

01:56.342 --> 01:59.066
Ooh. I may regret this
哦。我可能会后悔这一点

01:59.170 --> 02:01.549
but it looks like
we do have an opening.
但看起来像
我们确实有一个空缺。

02:01.963 --> 02:04.170
See you at the firehouse,
I guess.
消防站见
我猜。

02:04.273 --> 02:06.135
<i>The next day.</i>
<i>第二天。</i>

02:10.480 --> 02:12.480
Gahhoydin!
加霍伊丁！

02:12.584 --> 02:14.377
You okay there, SpongeBob?
你还好吗，海绵宝宝？

02:14.480 --> 02:17.549
Oh, yeah. Haha.
Reporting for duty!
哦，是的。哈哈。
到岗报到！

02:17.652 --> 02:19.894
Meow. Meow--
喵。喵——

02:22.549 --> 02:25.308
I brought my own snail-mation!
我带来了我自己的蜗牛伴侣！

02:25.411 --> 02:27.032
Okay.
好的。

02:27.135 --> 02:29.377
Well, welcome
to the Bikini Bottom
嗯，欢迎
到比基尼底部

02:29.480 --> 02:31.342
Volunteer Fire Department!
志愿消防队！

02:31.446 --> 02:34.101
Oh, yeah! Where's the fire?
Where's the fire?
哦，是啊！火在哪里？
火在哪里？

02:34.204 --> 02:36.584
I'm gonna fight it!
I'm gonna fight it!
我要对抗它！
我要对抗它！

02:36.687 --> 02:37.721
Where is it? Where? Where?
它在哪里？在哪里？在哪里？

02:37.825 --> 02:39.411
Yep. I'm regretting it.
是的。我很后悔。

02:40.928 --> 02:43.963
Here we keep the hoses
that extinguish the fires.
我们把软管放在这里
来扑灭大火。

02:45.308 --> 02:48.480
Well, they sure extinguished
my thirst!
好吧，他们确实熄灭了
我的渴！

02:50.377 --> 02:51.928
Upstairs.
楼上。

02:52.997 --> 02:56.549
This is the bunk room
where we rest up between fires.
这是双层床房
我们在火灾之间休息的地方。

02:56.652 --> 02:58.790
Ooh! Should I pick a bunk?
哦！我应该选择双层床吗？

02:58.894 --> 03:02.066
No, too soft.
Too hard.
不行，太软了。
太难了。

03:02.756 --> 03:04.963
Tutu?
图图？

03:05.377 --> 03:07.894
Too lumpy. Whoa.
太块了。哇哦。

03:08.377 --> 03:09.239
Patrick!
帕特里克！

03:09.342 --> 03:11.756
I'm gonna start fires!
我要放火了！

03:11.859 --> 03:15.584
Put out fires.
We put out fires.
扑灭大火。
我们扑灭了大火。

03:15.687 --> 03:17.756
If you say so.
如果你这么说的话。

03:17.859 --> 03:20.756
Rookie,
meet your fellow volunteer,
菜鸟，
认识你的志愿者同伴，

03:20.859 --> 03:22.687
Charmed, I'm sure.
我确信，很着迷。

03:22.790 --> 03:25.273
My pleasure. You look familiar.
我的荣幸。你看起来很熟悉。

03:25.480 --> 03:27.066
Hey! What's that?
嘿！那是什么？

03:27.170 --> 03:29.446
The First Fire?
第一场火灾？

03:29.549 --> 03:30.859
Wow!
哇！

03:30.963 --> 03:34.308
Is this the first fire
in the history of forever?
这是第一次火灾吗
在历史上永远？

03:34.411 --> 03:38.273
No. It's the first fire
we ever got called to.
不，这是第一场火灾
我们曾经被叫过。

03:38.377 --> 03:40.032
We keep it as a memento.
我们把它留作纪念。

03:40.135 --> 03:42.308
Hey! Fire poles!
嘿！火柱！

03:42.790 --> 03:46.066
Wow! Can we slide
down the poles?
哇！我们可以滑吗
沿着两极？

03:46.480 --> 03:48.480
Hold on there, greenhorns.
等等，新手们。

03:48.584 --> 03:50.790
You need to learn
which one to use.
你需要学习
使用哪一个。

03:50.894 --> 03:52.928
This is the pole
to the fire boat.
这是杆子
到消防船。

03:53.032 --> 03:54.963
This one's to the kitchen.
这是去厨房的。

03:55.928 --> 03:57.411
It's slippery.
很滑。

03:57.515 --> 03:59.204
It's buttered.
是涂了黄油的

03:59.652 --> 04:01.480
This pole goes to the bathroom.
这根杆子通向浴室。

04:01.584 --> 04:03.377
That's my ride.
这就是我的旅程。

04:04.859 --> 04:07.825
Ooh. Where does this pole go?
哦。这根柱子去哪儿了？

04:07.928 --> 04:09.859
Oh, that one's the mystery pole.
哦，那是神秘的柱子。

04:09.963 --> 04:12.928
It never goes
to the same place twice.
它永远不会过去
去同一个地方两次。

04:13.032 --> 04:14.756
I love a mystery!
我喜欢神秘！

04:14.859 --> 04:16.618
- Yay!
- No! Wait!
- 耶！
- 不！等待！

04:24.928 --> 04:26.584
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!
哇！哇！哇！哇！

04:26.687 --> 04:28.687
How do you stop
this crazy thing?
你怎么停下来
这疯狂的事？

04:28.790 --> 04:30.480
Hit the brakes!
踩刹车！

04:37.721 --> 04:40.204
No! No! Huh?
不！不！啊？

04:51.032 --> 04:52.859
Do you still love a mystery?
你还喜欢神秘吗？

04:52.963 --> 04:56.032
Not so much these days.
这些天不那么多了。

04:56.549 --> 04:58.480
All right. Line up!
好的。排队！

04:59.273 --> 05:00.618
Squidward!
章鱼哥！

05:00.721 --> 05:02.480
You volunteered too?
你也是自愿的吗？

05:02.584 --> 05:04.756
Not me. Mr. Krabs.
不是我。蟹老板。

05:04.859 --> 05:07.480
He was court-mandated for this
他因此被法庭责令

05:07.584 --> 05:09.549
but sent me in his stead.
但派我代替他。

05:09.652 --> 05:10.756
I'm a proxy.
我是代理人。

05:10.859 --> 05:14.584
Ooh. Hi, proxy.
I'm boxy.
哦。你好，代理。
我是四四方方的。

05:14.687 --> 05:16.515
I'm foxy.
我很狡猾。

05:16.618 --> 05:19.135
Well, then I'm an escapee.
好吧，那我就是逃犯了。

05:20.480 --> 05:21.756
All right. Listen up!
好的。听着！

05:21.859 --> 05:23.756
This is the training area.
这是训练区。

05:23.859 --> 05:25.997
The reason why
there are three of you
原因是
你们三个人

05:26.101 --> 05:28.446
is because one Old Man Walker
是因为一位沃克老人

05:28.549 --> 05:30.135
is worth three good men.
抵得上三个好男人。

05:30.239 --> 05:32.584
And I couldn't find
three good men
而我却找不到
三个好男人

05:32.687 --> 05:37.239
so I got you...
所以我得到了你...

05:41.204 --> 05:43.963
Your training starts now!
你的训练现在开始！

05:44.066 --> 05:46.135
And hopefully ends
at some point.
并希望结束
在某个时刻。

05:46.239 --> 05:48.825
First up, fire hose skills.
首先，消防水带技能。

05:48.928 --> 05:54.549
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!
哇！哇！哇！

05:54.652 --> 05:57.066
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!
哇！哇！哇！

06:03.687 --> 06:05.997
Help! Fire!
帮助！火！

06:06.101 --> 06:08.997
Someone save my baby!
谁来救救我的宝贝吧！

06:09.170 --> 06:11.066
We'll save your baby!
我们会救你的孩子的！

06:11.170 --> 06:14.170
Careful, SpongeBob. Slowly.
小心点，海绵宝宝。慢慢地。

06:14.273 --> 06:18.584
Save my baby!
救救我的宝贝！

06:21.411 --> 06:25.480
- Mama!
- What she said!
- 妈妈！
- 她说什么！

06:29.825 --> 06:31.549
Oh.
哦。

06:31.721 --> 06:33.480
I saved the baby, chief.
我救了孩子，长官。

06:33.584 --> 06:35.342
And what about the mother?
那么母亲呢？

06:35.446 --> 06:36.859
The-the mother?
那——母亲？

06:41.997 --> 06:43.377
The mother!
母亲！

06:45.032 --> 06:46.963
Congratulations, men.
恭喜你们，伙计们。

06:47.101 --> 06:48.652
You passed your training.
你通过了训练。

06:48.756 --> 06:50.618
- Yeah!
- Woohoo!
- 是的！
- 哇哦！

06:50.721 --> 06:51.928
Kill me now.
现在就杀了我吧。

06:52.032 --> 06:55.101
You're all
volunteer firefighters.
你们都是
志愿消防员。

06:55.687 --> 06:57.308
Huzzah.
万岁。

06:57.411 --> 06:58.790
Huh?
啊？

06:58.894 --> 07:01.859
Sorry, Squidward. We're out of
fire helmets and walkie talkies.
对不起，章鱼哥。我们已经没了
消防头盔和对讲机。

07:01.963 --> 07:03.308
But, um...
但是，嗯...

07:03.411 --> 07:06.101
Here's some stuff left over
from our last party.
这是剩下的一些东西
从我们上次聚会开始。

07:11.135 --> 07:13.239
Another pet in a tree?
树上还有一只宠物？

07:13.342 --> 07:14.997
I've got better things to do.
我还有更重要的事情要做。

07:15.101 --> 07:17.377
Like sleep. Hmm?
就像睡觉一样。唔？

07:17.480 --> 07:18.515
Look alive, men!
看起来还活着，伙计们！

07:18.618 --> 07:21.032
You've got your
very first assignment!
你有你的
第一个作业！

07:27.928 --> 07:31.480
It's Spot!
He's stuck in the tree!
是现货！
他被困在树上了！

07:33.515 --> 07:36.032
Wow.
哇。

07:38.584 --> 07:41.204
What was I thinking?
It's SpongeBob!
我在想什么？
这是海绵宝宝！

07:41.308 --> 07:43.825
Never mind. Sorry to bother you.
没关系。很抱歉打扰你。

07:43.928 --> 07:45.411
He can stay in the tree.
他可以留在树上。

07:45.515 --> 07:47.170
Step aside, citizen.
公民，靠边站吧。

07:47.273 --> 07:48.963
Ladder. First aid. Blanket!
梯子。急救。毯子！

07:49.066 --> 07:51.170
Hustle, people!
喧嚣，人们！

08:00.377 --> 08:03.342
Yeah, this is firefighter
SpongeBob to Chief Larry.
是的，这是消防员
海绵宝宝对拉里酋长说。

08:03.446 --> 08:06.928
<i>The rescue subject just
regurgitated all over Patrick.</i>
<i>救援对象刚刚
帕特里克浑身反流。</i>

08:08.446 --> 08:10.308
<i>Squidward got hurled on too.</i>
<i>章鱼哥也被扔了。</i>

08:12.894 --> 08:14.584
Keep up the good work.
继续做好工作。

08:18.549 --> 08:19.756
Come on, boy.
来吧，男孩。

08:19.859 --> 08:20.928
Jump!
跳！

08:21.032 --> 08:23.790
Meow.
喵。

08:28.032 --> 08:29.480
Good snail-mation!
好蜗牛！

08:29.584 --> 08:30.584
Huh?
啊？

08:30.687 --> 08:31.997
Do you hear that?
你听到了吗？

08:32.101 --> 08:33.756
There's a fire somewhere!
某处着火了！

08:33.859 --> 08:36.101
A real fire!
真正的火！

08:37.411 --> 08:38.446
Hustle!
喧嚣！

08:42.308 --> 08:44.170
Huh?
啊？

08:44.894 --> 08:46.825
Oh, uh, Squidward.
The siren is broken.
哦，呃，章鱼哥。
警笛坏了。

08:46.928 --> 08:48.515
Could you, uh, [honks].
你可以吗，呃，[喇叭]。

08:52.308 --> 08:54.584
Watch where you're going, bozo!
小心你要去哪里，老兄！

08:57.756 --> 08:59.997
A fire house on fire.
一座消防屋着火了。

09:00.101 --> 09:01.618
Talk about your cheap irony.
谈谈你的廉价讽刺。

09:02.721 --> 09:04.135
Help!
帮助！

09:04.239 --> 09:06.618
The First Fire escaped!
第一把火逃走了！

09:12.480 --> 09:15.308
Save me!
救救我吧！

09:17.687 --> 09:19.170
Okay. Jump!
好的。跳！

09:19.894 --> 09:23.687
Whoa!
哇！

09:24.273 --> 09:26.170
Well, that was a rip off!
好吧，那真是敲诈了！

09:27.101 --> 09:29.825
Okay, men. Fire hose skills!
好吧，男人们。消防水带技能！

09:34.342 --> 09:38.446
Mother of Pearl!
珍珠母！

09:39.066 --> 09:42.066
Don't worry, you're saved!
别担心，你有救了！

09:42.170 --> 09:43.859
Hey! You know--
嘿！你知道 -

09:50.480 --> 09:54.515
Did somebody
need three good men?
有人吗
需要三个好男人吗？

09:54.618 --> 09:55.825
Meow! Meow!
喵！喵！

09:56.377 --> 09:59.204
Now, hold on in there, you kids.
现在，坚持住，孩子们。

10:20.825 --> 10:23.101
Wow!
哇！

10:23.928 --> 10:25.342
Ha! Didn't I tell ya
哈!我不是告诉过你吗

10:25.446 --> 10:27.894
Old Man Walker
is worth three good men?
沃克老人
值三个好男人吗？

10:27.997 --> 10:29.825
Hey! Where's SpongeBob?
嘿！海绵宝宝在哪里？

10:29.928 --> 10:31.894
Yes! I saved it!
是的！我救了它！

10:31.997 --> 10:34.101
I saved the First Fire!
我救了第一场大火！

10:34.204 --> 10:37.066
Whoa!
哇！

10:41.790 --> 10:44.997
I wonder if I can volunteer
for something safer.
我想知道我是否可以做志愿者
为了更安全的事情。

10:45.342 --> 10:47.825
Medical experiments.
That sounds good.
医学实验。
听起来很好。

10:47.928 --> 10:49.342
This is your lucky day!
这是你的幸运日！

10:49.446 --> 10:51.963
I'm also a volunteer doctor.
我也是一名志愿医生。

我也是一名志愿医生。